  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are extremely resilient against psychic enervation.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Enervation Fortitude.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you suffer psychic enervation, do not lose any hit points or power points, although you still suffer any additional effects like being stunned or sickened. In addition, you can expend one use of mythic power when you would suffer psychic enervation to negate the psychic enervation and instead gain surging euphoria.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-enhancement-feats#toc14\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
